<overview>
<p>The Free Worlds League's fractious politics have always made centralized BattleMech procurement difficult, pushing the FWLM toward heavy investment in conventional infantry to fill the gaps. Towing crew-served Ultra autocannon/20, these platoons wield the most devastating rapid-fire direct weapon available to conventional infantry. Double-firing an AC/20-class weapon produces tremendous destruction at short range, though the strain on the mechanism makes jamming a serious concern.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of ultra-class autocannon
</notes>

